{"id":"vod_sn_38768","vodId":"38768","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"满脑都是○○的我没办法谈恋爱","name_cn":"满脑都是○○的我没办法谈恋爱","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/29099581a35e3525ce76f3aa79d9bcea.jpg"},"summary":"堀江青（和气杏未 配音）表面看来是一位非常平凡而且害羞的女子高中生，实际上，她的父亲是大名鼎鼎的官能小说家，这让青感到非常的自卑，并且常常陷入困扰之中。青最大的愿望，就是能够摆脱父亲的存在，开始独自一人的生活，为此，她非常努力的用工念书，希望能够考上理想的大学。　　让青没有想到的是，班上的风云人物，和自己八竿子都打不到一起的木岛（寺岛惇太 配音）竟然和自己告白了，虽然处于本能，青拒绝了木岛，但是实际上，她对木岛的存在非常的在意。恋爱还没有开始，青的脑海里就已经充满了桃红色的幻想，这样下去，她人生的第一次恋爱能够成功吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hSc81055xD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uX7u7htJFW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QKn4pS96SR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aT7gp8G7xD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Htwm6LTEQP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DF9acAWs9C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BPBzmJnLjS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JwG0rLk3NH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HXmh23Dww71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YhTwisHGVG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HhcXgviDm71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LYaBkBfUy01/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.856Z"}